171 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 73 0 R/T(Dimitra Siatitsa is an urban researcher and planner based in Athens. Her work focuses on housing, urban development, and the politics of the city, with particular attention to social inequality and spatial justice. She has worked on urban governance, neighborhood transformation, and the everyday life of cities in the context of crisis and redevelopment. Athens serves as both her main base and a central reference point in her work.)/E(Dimitra Siatitsa is an urban researcher and planner based in Athens. Her work focuses on housing, urban development, and the politics of the city, with particular attention to social inequality and spatial justice. She has worked on urban governance, neighborhood transformation, and the everyday life of cities in the context of crisis and redevelopment. Athens serves as both her main base and a central reference point in her work.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[6]>>
