405 0 obj
<</Title(Justyna Orchowska is a sociologist and Deputy Head of the Urban Studies Programme at the University of Warsaw. Her research focuses on urban sociology, housing studies, class theory, social inequality, and access to public services. She is the author and co-author of numerous academic and expert publications, including Blank Spots. Warsaw Residents on Public Services. She has led and participated in research projects and worked as an expert for public institutions and NGOs. She is also active in Warsaw\220s urban and civic movements)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 377 0 R>>
endobj

